            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is The Ragdoll? </h2><br>The Ragdoll is a fast-paced, action filled fighting game, which looks back to our childhood-favorite stickman fight games but with modern twists.<br>In this game you'll have the chance to have fun either alone or with your friends and even with strangers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br>            • Three different, themed tournaments<br>            • Dozens of unlockable skins<br>            • Dozens of different objects to fight with<br>            • 15+ unlockable maps<br>            • Local quick game and co-op tournaments<br>            • Online co-op tournaments and two PvP game modes,<br>            • Full controller support<br>            • 15+ achievements<br>            • Puns",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is The Ragdoll? </h2><br>The Ragdoll is a fast-paced, action filled fighting game, which looks back to our childhood-favorite stickman fight games but with modern twists.<br>In this game you'll have the chance to have fun either alone or with your friends and even with strangers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br>            • Three different, themed tournaments<br>            • Dozens of unlockable skins<br>            • Dozens of different objects to fight with<br>            • 15+ unlockable maps<br>            • Local quick game and co-op tournaments<br>            • Online co-op tournaments and two PvP game modes,<br>            • Full controller support<br>            • 15+ achievements<br>            • Puns",
